   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Puts a product (or any subject) on a new generated background. BiRefNet cuts the subject out, SDXL paints a new background around it,\nand the original subject is pasted back pixel-exact.\nPrompt = the new scene: \"on a white marble countertop, soft morning light, shallow depth of field, product photography\".\nEdge: Shrink edge protects the subject's border (2 px). The input is resized to about 1 megapixel.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
